{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HEIST GONE WRONG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be simple: Infiltrate a <strong>private island paradise</strong>, steal a <strong>priceless piece of art</strong>, and <strong>get out alive</strong>. Now look at you: Lost inside a dream, inside a dream, inside a dream. How did you get here? Who built this place? And how do you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOST INSIDE A DREAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the open world freely either on foot, by motorboat, or via paraglider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> notes, read emails, steal; do anything that will get you off the islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend</strong> yourself against security bots with automatic weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete first-person <strong>platforming</strong> puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hand-holding</strong>; find your way without map markers or quest logs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OH JACKIE, WHAT HAVE YOU DONE...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SERPENT AT THE VERNISSAGE</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure</strong> set in an abandoned island paradise, where nothing is quite what it seems. <strong>Explore</strong> forgotten villas, sentient art pieces and sunken opera houses. And <strong>find your way back home</strong> before the archipelago swallows you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855760?t=1757692432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/a879124688940a2dda249f9f7eddef372a0747b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757692432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/6cb8dd678ca59100caa3fbc464266fbdd25f5b24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757692432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/6cb8dd678ca59100caa3fbc464266fbdd25f5b24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757692432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HEIST GONE WRONG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be simple: Infiltrate a <strong>private island paradise</strong>, steal a <strong>priceless piece of art</strong>, and <strong>get out alive</strong>. Now look at you: Lost inside a dream, inside a dream, inside a dream. How did you get here? Who built this place? And how do you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/a4450e3c21e8b43af499276c22bb5df9.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOST INSIDE A DREAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the open world freely either on foot, by motorboat, or via paraglider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> notes, read emails, steal; do anything that will get you off the islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend</strong> yourself against security bots with automatic weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete first-person <strong>platforming</strong> puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hand-holding</strong>; find your way without map markers or quest logs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OH JACKIE, WHAT HAVE YOU DONE...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SERPENT AT THE VERNISSAGE</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure</strong> set in an abandoned island paradise, where nothing is quite what it seems. <strong>Explore</strong> forgotten villas, sentient art pieces and sunken opera houses. And <strong>find your way back home</strong> before the archipelago swallows you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.poster.avif?t=1757692432\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.webm?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.mp4?t=1757692432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Dan